      note: "CAISO + NYISO keeper (NYISO: nyiso-92, armed jointly with the mirrored min-flow floor as one two-sided family; every material gas class's hourly r up in every year). ISO-agnostic engine untested for PJM/NEISO (fleets material). PJM TRIAGED at pjm-146 (2026-08-02, no solve): DATA-BLOCKED — the deriver reads EIA-930 NG:WAT hourly, and PJM's is the PS-contaminated fold the pjm-143 keeper adjudicated (no NG:PS column; +6.5-7.0 TWh/yr = +72-78% pumped-storage gross discharge; breaches the 3,334 MW conventional nameplate 1,437-1,572 h/yr), so a month x hod p95 ceiling would encode Bath County's cycling onto conventional hydro — the same wrong-population defect refused at the level, at hourly grain (rule 14 misalignment clause). Blocked until a PS-separated hourly series exists for the PJM footprint (docs/handoffs/pjm-matrix-column-triage-2026-08.md §2.4).",
