      note: "REFUTED AT BOTH TESTED ENDS: ERCOT West/Panhandle/CREZ split CLOSED (no CREZ interface exists in the GTC vocabulary — inventing one refused, rules 5/13/14; missing epochs are SUB-zonal 138kV elements); MISO RO-3: NO zonal granularity captures its internal congestion mass — NO-BUILD is fundamental. Do not re-open without new sub-zonal data intake.",
