      note: "NYISO keeper (~1.2-1.5 GW at $500 strike). ERCOT backcast DR refused BY CONSTRUCTION — metered load already contains realized 4CP/ERS response; only forecast-mode leg A is live scope (DR charter §1). PJM/MISO/NEISO emergency-DR blocks untested (each needs its own program registry).",
